sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant P as You (the reviewer)
    participant D as Your Mac
    A->>P: I want to delete /config. OK?
    Note over A,P: the agent is paused and waits
    alt you say no
        P->>A: reject: "Never delete config"
        A-->>P: OK, I did not delete it
    else you say yes
        P->>A: approve
        A->>D: delete /config for real
    end
